WEBVTT

01:35.759 --> 01:40.789
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.600 --> 01:44.000
[Episode 8]

01:44.789 --> 01:45.850
Prince of Zhennan?

01:46.870 --> 01:48.600
It was you who saved me that day,

01:48.920 --> 01:50.320
and you had also let me go.

01:51.350 --> 01:52.350
Princess Xiyang.

01:53.350 --> 01:54.640
I truly don't remember.

01:54.640 --> 01:56.039
I am your captive.

01:57.120 --> 01:58.310
Please be careful with your words.

01:58.310 --> 01:59.910
You are a precious princess,

01:59.920 --> 02:00.920
never my captive.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.530
But you've stolen my heart.

02:03.040 --> 02:04.710
From that day on, I finally
understood that

02:04.710 --> 02:06.310
women were never meant
for the battlefield.

02:06.310 --> 02:08.240
I cannot follow my Brother's path.

02:08.470 --> 02:09.710
From that day on,

02:11.250 --> 02:11.840
my heart

02:11.840 --> 02:13.360
has been tied to yours.

02:18.240 --> 02:18.800
No,

02:20.000 --> 02:20.800
you're wrong.

02:22.680 --> 02:23.810
There was a woman

02:24.520 --> 02:25.910
who not only went into battle,

02:25.910 --> 02:28.170
but became a hero far surpassing any man.

02:31.870 --> 02:35.280
Don't cry, don't cry

02:36.400 --> 02:38.130
I've shared so much with you,

02:38.050 --> 02:41.790
I'll remember the way home

02:39.079 --> 02:41.170
yet you thinking of another woman.

02:41.590 --> 02:42.550
Do you know that

02:42.750 --> 02:43.710
in order to marry you,

02:43.710 --> 02:45.460
I even offended my Brother?

02:46.910 --> 02:50.140
Don't cry

02:47.400 --> 02:48.730
I just wanted to say that

02:49.590 --> 02:51.120
women can also go to war.

02:52.980 --> 02:57.670
I'll find my way home

02:56.590 --> 02:57.850
What is her name?

03:03.080 --> 03:04.200
General of Jinxiu,

03:04.840 --> 03:05.850
Fu Yixiao.

03:12.240 --> 03:13.240
Princess Xiyang,

03:13.910 --> 03:14.970
I'll take my leave.

03:23.560 --> 03:24.720
Fu Yixiao?

03:44.650 --> 03:45.800
It's the Prince of Zhennan from Jinxiu

03:45.800 --> 03:47.110
and our First Prince.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.290
Yes.

03:48.440 --> 03:50.220
These two are sworn enemies.

03:56.280 --> 03:57.590
Prince of Zhennan.

03:58.910 --> 03:59.870
We meet again.

04:00.310 --> 04:00.910
Yes.

04:01.870 --> 04:02.890
We've met at

04:03.080 --> 04:04.410
the Battle of Pingling.

04:05.480 --> 04:07.000
We were so close to success.

04:07.000 --> 04:08.860
If Pingling City had fallen then,

04:09.120 --> 04:09.850
you would now be

04:09.850 --> 04:11.290
my prisoner.

04:12.310 --> 04:13.600
What a pity.

04:14.150 --> 04:15.310
Indeed a pity.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.480
A pity that arrow

04:17.510 --> 04:19.110
lacked just a bit more force.

04:19.510 --> 04:21.040
Otherwise, Yujing City today

04:21.040 --> 04:22.580
wouldn't be celebrating,

04:22.830 --> 04:24.350
but mourning instead.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.130
You see,

04:26.310 --> 04:28.070
in this world, disappointments

04:28.070 --> 04:29.180
are aplenty.

04:30.160 --> 04:31.760
Do you have Yixiao?

04:34.000 --> 04:34.870
Yixiao?

04:37.310 --> 04:39.040
I happen to have a concubine

04:39.040 --> 04:40.030
named Yixiao.

04:40.310 --> 04:42.110
Could she be the one you speak of?

04:42.510 --> 04:43.550
Concubine?

04:44.159 --> 04:45.620
I found her by the roadside

04:45.720 --> 04:47.680
and took her in out of pity.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.840
She was deeply grateful

04:49.950 --> 04:51.680
and wants to repay me with her life.

04:51.680 --> 04:54.280
So, I graciously accepted her
as my concubine.

04:55.560 --> 04:56.890
If you are still holding

04:57.070 --> 04:58.070
a grudge for that arrow shot

04:58.070 --> 04:59.720
during the Battle of Pingling,

04:59.720 --> 05:01.060
just blame it on me.

05:01.270 --> 05:02.730
I ordered her to shoot you.

05:02.950 --> 05:04.350
None of this is her fault.

05:14.780 --> 05:16.760
The score between her and me,

05:17.050 --> 05:18.850
you want me to settle it with you?

05:19.040 --> 05:20.190
On what grounds?

05:21.560 --> 05:22.360
I once swore

05:22.360 --> 05:23.790
to protect her for life.

05:25.070 --> 05:26.800
You claim to be protecting her.

05:27.160 --> 05:28.600
But when her life was hanging by a thread,

05:28.600 --> 05:29.160
where were you?

05:29.160 --> 05:31.000
When she was severely wounded
and being hunted,

05:31.000 --> 05:32.300
where were you then?

05:32.560 --> 05:34.010
None of your business.

05:34.070 --> 05:35.800
You've already forgotten what I just said.

05:35.800 --> 05:37.070
She belongs to my household,

05:37.070 --> 05:38.480
so of course it concerns me.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.970
Yixiao is one of

05:40.070 --> 05:42.120
the Three Heroes of Jinxiu under my command,

05:42.120 --> 05:43.390
my right-hand woman,

05:43.409 --> 05:44.870
someone I cannot afford to lose.

05:44.870 --> 05:46.920
I ask you, the First Prince,
to do me this favor

05:46.920 --> 05:48.050
and return her to me.

05:48.100 --> 05:49.500
If she's that important,

05:50.270 --> 05:51.300
then it seems

05:51.630 --> 05:53.960
I definitely can't give you what you want.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.600
Then what would it take for you

05:57.600 --> 05:58.880
to give her back to me?

05:59.190 --> 06:00.200
Xia Jingshi,

06:01.000 --> 06:01.920
have you forgotten that

06:01.920 --> 06:03.420
Fu Yixiao is a person,

06:03.720 --> 06:05.420
not some stray cat or dog?

06:05.750 --> 06:07.190
If she wishes to leave,
I don't need to return her,

06:07.190 --> 06:08.110
nor do I need to release her.

06:08.110 --> 06:09.750
She'll leave of her own accord.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.940
Does she know I've come to Susha?

06:10.940 --> 06:11.620
Of course.

06:11.830 --> 06:12.650
She knows you're here

06:12.650 --> 06:13.770
to marry my sister.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.280
Let's go back.

06:20.940 --> 06:21.740
Oh, by the way,

06:22.390 --> 06:23.830
I can return the other one of

06:23.830 --> 06:25.720
your Three Heroes of Jinxiu.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.120
He is...

06:27.580 --> 06:28.600
What was his name again?

06:28.600 --> 06:29.290
Ning Fei.

06:30.520 --> 06:31.630
The one named Ning Fei.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.800
You can take him back.

06:32.800 --> 06:34.480
I've already sent him to your inn

06:34.480 --> 06:36.830
with just... three broken ribs.

06:38.070 --> 06:39.130
No need to thank me.

06:45.200 --> 06:46.000
Let's go back!

07:09.400 --> 07:10.960
Slow down. Don't move.

07:11.560 --> 07:12.390
I'm fine,

07:12.510 --> 07:13.240
don't worry.

07:15.070 --> 07:16.870
How many fingers am I holding up?

07:17.730 --> 07:18.770
I can see clearly.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.130
No, let me check again.

07:26.600 --> 07:27.740
I told you I'm fine.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.860
Yes, you are.

07:28.950 --> 07:29.560
You have no idea

07:29.560 --> 07:30.630
how terrifying you were just now,

07:30.630 --> 07:32.230
swinging your sword wildly.

07:32.920 --> 07:34.570
I just had a nightmare.

07:35.390 --> 07:37.920
I dreamt that I was
surrounded by many people.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.159
I fought desperately,

07:39.159 --> 07:40.690
fighting with all my might,

07:41.560 --> 07:43.680
but I couldn't eliminate all my enemies.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.080
What happened back then?

07:45.190 --> 07:46.720
How did you end up like this?

07:47.270 --> 07:48.440
I saw them.

07:49.120 --> 07:49.790
Who?

07:51.120 --> 07:52.220
Those people from Jinxiu.

07:51.390 --> 07:51.850
[Nan]

07:52.360 --> 07:53.130
Kill!

07:53.159 --> 07:54.010
Kill!

07:54.040 --> 07:55.159
-Kill!
-Kill!

07:55.240 --> 07:56.270
Do you know someone

07:56.270 --> 07:57.190
named Ning Fei?

07:58.470 --> 07:59.770
I've heard the name,

08:00.660 --> 08:02.060
but I don't remember anyone.

08:02.060 --> 08:03.660
He claims to be your brother.

08:03.680 --> 08:05.040
He came looking for you earlier,

08:05.040 --> 08:06.770
but was beaten up by Feng Suige.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.190
His injuries are serious.

08:08.190 --> 08:09.450
With those injuries,

08:09.480 --> 08:11.190
if treated by an incompetent doctor,

08:11.190 --> 08:11.870
he might suffer from

08:11.870 --> 08:13.140
permanent damage.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.240
Xueying.

08:14.920 --> 08:15.720
Then please go

08:15.720 --> 08:16.850
check on his wounds.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.650
You're recalling him?

08:20.040 --> 08:22.000
I don't know yet if he's friend or foe.

08:22.000 --> 08:22.970
Regardless, help me

08:22.970 --> 08:24.100
treat his injuries.

08:24.310 --> 08:24.970
What if...

08:25.000 --> 08:27.120
he really is my good friend from before?

08:27.120 --> 08:27.760
Alright.

08:28.070 --> 08:29.070
I'll do as you say.

08:33.990 --> 08:36.480
[Inn]

08:51.910 --> 08:52.490
I'm done.

08:54.000 --> 08:54.770
Thank you, Miss Ling,

08:54.770 --> 08:56.080
for coming to treat me personally.

08:56.080 --> 08:57.120
Appreciate the trouble.

08:57.120 --> 08:59.030
I couldn't care less about your affairs.

08:59.030 --> 09:00.650
I'm just doing someone a favor

09:00.650 --> 09:01.850
and couldn't refuse.

09:03.270 --> 09:04.530
Doing someone a favor?

09:05.080 --> 09:06.000
Is it Yixiao?

09:07.150 --> 09:07.870
Miss Ling.

09:08.030 --> 09:09.270
How is Yixiao doing?

09:11.510 --> 09:12.150
Miss Ling!

09:13.690 --> 09:15.150
You've broken three ribs.

09:15.200 --> 09:16.810
Although I've treated the wound
and applied medicine,

09:16.810 --> 09:19.200
it's best you do not move around
for the next three days.

09:19.200 --> 09:21.670
Be careful not to let bone fragments
pierce your lungs or heart,

09:21.670 --> 09:23.270
or there'll be no saving you.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.730
I'm fine.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.390
Miss Ling.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.350
Is Yixiao doing well?

09:34.200 --> 09:34.740
No.

09:37.320 --> 09:37.990
Miss Ling.

09:38.840 --> 09:40.310
How is Yixiao doing now?

09:40.770 --> 09:42.030
I hope you will tell me.

09:46.150 --> 09:47.410
She's lost her memory.

09:47.550 --> 09:49.150
Her left hand is injured too.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.120
She doesn't remember Jinxiu,

09:51.120 --> 09:52.520
or the Prince of Zhennan.

09:55.390 --> 09:58.120
Nor does she remember
the Three Heroes of Jinxiu.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.600
Lost her memory?

10:03.150 --> 10:04.480
She remembers nothing?

10:05.080 --> 10:06.320
What's wrong with you people?

10:06.320 --> 10:07.100
Can't you even protect

10:07.100 --> 10:08.160
your own comrade?

10:13.610 --> 10:14.450
Miss Ling,

10:15.270 --> 10:16.470
does Zhengnian Villa have any way

10:16.470 --> 10:17.400
to treat Yixiao?

10:18.240 --> 10:19.300
Whatever you need,

10:19.480 --> 10:21.200
Prince Zhennan's Mansion
will do our best to help.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.240
She is no longer

10:22.240 --> 10:24.040
the Red-Clad General of Jinxiu.

10:28.870 --> 10:29.930
The prescription.

10:30.030 --> 10:30.630
Thank you.

10:40.200 --> 10:40.860
How are you?

10:41.390 --> 10:42.320
Are you alright?

10:45.200 --> 10:45.870
Fu Yixiao!

11:13.120 --> 11:14.630
What happened on the city wall...

11:14.630 --> 11:15.240
Thank you.

11:16.790 --> 11:17.990
I'm glad you're well.

11:19.790 --> 11:20.690
I heard...

11:22.270 --> 11:24.120
you attacked my former comrade?

11:25.790 --> 11:26.320
Yes.

11:28.960 --> 11:29.870
Why did you act

11:29.870 --> 11:31.330
without any explanation?

11:31.480 --> 11:32.750
I spared his miserable life

11:32.750 --> 11:34.110
only because of you.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.400
If I don't punish him,

11:36.440 --> 11:37.120
wouldn't that mean

11:37.120 --> 11:37.960
any Tom, Dick, or Harry

11:37.960 --> 11:39.390
will dare to cause trouble
at my residence?

11:39.390 --> 11:41.050
Besides, you belong to me now.

11:42.630 --> 11:44.030
Let's make things clear.

11:44.630 --> 11:46.230
I have never belonged to you.

11:46.870 --> 11:48.650
Still sharp-tongued as ever.

11:48.750 --> 11:49.730
You must be fine.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.960
Didn't you spare my life and

11:51.960 --> 11:53.320
seek my cooperation back then

11:53.320 --> 11:54.120
precisely to help me

11:54.120 --> 11:55.240
recover my memories quickly,

11:55.240 --> 11:56.080
so I could uncover

11:56.080 --> 11:57.600
who in Susha is
collaborating with the enemy?

11:57.600 --> 11:59.240
So why did you stop me today?

11:59.840 --> 12:01.770
I can wait while you slowly recall.

12:01.790 --> 12:02.840
I have plenty of patience.

12:02.840 --> 12:03.390
You may have patience,

12:03.390 --> 12:04.790
but I don't have time.

12:04.820 --> 12:06.550
After all, you're not the one
who lost your memory.

12:06.550 --> 12:07.870
You have no idea how I feel.

12:07.870 --> 12:08.550
I'm in a lot of agony now.

12:08.550 --> 12:09.960
My thoughts are completely chaotic.

12:09.960 --> 12:10.670
I need someone

12:10.670 --> 12:12.120
to help me sort things out.

12:12.120 --> 12:14.150
I cannot let you see Xia Jingshi.

12:21.480 --> 12:23.150
I'm not asking for your permission.

12:23.150 --> 12:24.790
I'm not asking for it either.

12:38.320 --> 12:40.480
With Yixiao's strong-willed personality,

12:40.480 --> 12:41.240
now that

12:42.840 --> 12:43.630
she's lost

12:43.630 --> 12:45.430
her most prized archery skills,

12:46.790 --> 12:48.590
how agonizing must it be for her?

12:50.910 --> 12:51.810
Your Highness,

12:51.870 --> 12:53.230
please give the order.

12:53.480 --> 12:54.750
Even if we have to
turn Yujing City upside down,

12:54.750 --> 12:56.200
we must rescue Yixiao.

12:56.790 --> 12:58.520
Your wounds haven't healed,
but you've forgotten the pain.

12:58.520 --> 13:00.150
Is this the time to be impulsive?

13:00.150 --> 13:00.970
Don't forget

13:01.120 --> 13:02.150
what we're here for.

13:02.150 --> 13:04.000
Is Yixiao more important than
the marriage alliance?

13:04.000 --> 13:05.790
If something goes wrong with
the marriage alliance,

13:05.790 --> 13:06.770
the Emperor of Shengjing City,

13:06.770 --> 13:09.150
will immediately strip
His Highness of military power.

13:09.150 --> 13:10.950
Don't you understand even that?

13:11.080 --> 13:11.540
Then...

13:16.360 --> 13:17.760
what do you suggest we do?

13:18.200 --> 13:19.000
When I think about Yixiao

13:19.000 --> 13:20.360
being in the tiger's den,

13:20.360 --> 13:22.000
I'm practically on pins and needles.

13:22.000 --> 13:22.270
Enough.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.870
How can I possibly stay calm?

13:24.910 --> 13:26.040
I'm considering...

13:27.320 --> 13:29.000
bringing the matter of rescuing Yixiao

13:29.000 --> 13:29.970
to the public.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.720
Your Highness, you mean...

13:34.720 --> 13:37.150
you want to make the Emperor of Susha
order her release?

13:37.150 --> 13:37.790
Yes.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.270
If the two states enter
the marriage alliance,

13:39.270 --> 13:40.840
it's only right they release our people.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.640
But we've just arrived in Susha.

13:42.670 --> 13:44.600
Making demands for her release now

13:44.600 --> 13:46.030
will inevitably invite speculation around

13:46.030 --> 13:46.960
Your Highness's true intentions

13:46.960 --> 13:48.390
behind your early arrival.

13:48.390 --> 13:50.080
Your Highness's early arrival

13:50.080 --> 13:51.870
can be for the marriage alliance,

13:51.870 --> 13:53.600
or for peace between our nations,

13:53.600 --> 13:55.720
or to demonstrate Jinxiu's sincerity,

13:55.720 --> 13:56.380
but it absolutely

13:56.380 --> 13:58.110
cannot be for a female general.

13:58.630 --> 13:59.430
That's right.

14:00.240 --> 14:02.030
We mustn't rush this matter.

14:02.790 --> 14:03.550
I will find an opportunity

14:03.550 --> 14:05.480
to request her release from Susha.

14:06.000 --> 14:06.530
Now that Yixiao

14:06.530 --> 14:07.990
has lost all her memories,

14:08.270 --> 14:09.200
why would she stay

14:09.200 --> 14:10.400
by Feng Suige's side?

14:10.960 --> 14:12.630
She must have her reasons.

14:13.910 --> 14:14.970
We need to find a way

14:15.270 --> 14:16.110
to see her.

14:30.670 --> 14:31.600
There was a woman

14:32.470 --> 14:33.840
who not only went into battle,

14:33.840 --> 14:35.970
but became a hero surpassing many men.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.480
What is her name?

14:39.480 --> 14:40.640
General of Jinxiu,

14:41.150 --> 14:42.000
Fu Yixiao.

15:07.000 --> 15:07.950
Try this.

15:08.270 --> 15:09.670
I had someone prepare it.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.360
We've finally

15:15.360 --> 15:16.890
put aside our differences,

15:17.000 --> 15:18.220
and agreed to work together

15:18.220 --> 15:19.420
to uncover the truth.

15:19.720 --> 15:21.140
Nothing and no one

15:21.630 --> 15:22.360
should ever

15:22.390 --> 15:23.780
come between us.

15:24.630 --> 15:26.490
I know you want to see Xia Jingshi

15:26.790 --> 15:28.240
because you're hoping his account

15:28.240 --> 15:28.750
might help you

15:28.750 --> 15:30.350
recover your memory faster.

15:30.840 --> 15:32.110
But you need to understand

15:32.110 --> 15:34.200
that any memory someone shares with you

15:34.200 --> 15:35.540
may not be the truth.

15:36.390 --> 15:37.920
I didn't want you to see them

15:38.550 --> 15:39.880
for no other reason than

15:40.030 --> 15:42.160
I was afraid you might be manipulated.

15:42.550 --> 15:43.810
I can judge for myself.

15:44.480 --> 15:46.210
I won't be easily manipulated.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.840
I understand how you feel right now.

15:48.840 --> 15:50.360
How could you possibly understand?

15:50.360 --> 15:52.320
You're not the one who lost your memory.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.030
I just want you

15:53.030 --> 15:54.230
to respect my wishes.

15:56.150 --> 15:57.810
At the Zhennan Pass of Jinxiu,

15:57.870 --> 15:58.600
those who have both

15:58.600 --> 15:59.670
the ability and opportunity to harm you

15:59.670 --> 16:00.590
are very few.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.930
This includes Xia Jingshi,

16:03.270 --> 16:03.790
as well as

16:03.790 --> 16:04.720
your two brothers from

16:04.720 --> 16:06.240
the Three Heroes of Jinxiu.

16:06.240 --> 16:06.960
I don't want

16:06.960 --> 16:08.000
you to trust anyone blindly.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.660
So I should trust you instead?

16:10.200 --> 16:11.860
When I agreed to work with you,

16:12.150 --> 16:13.150
you promised me

16:13.510 --> 16:15.240
I could leave anytime I wanted.

16:15.270 --> 16:16.320
But now I simply want

16:16.320 --> 16:17.790
to meet with Xia Jingshi

16:17.960 --> 16:19.360
in order to understand my circumstances,

16:19.360 --> 16:21.320
yet you're doing everything to stop me.

16:21.320 --> 16:22.380
How can I trust you?

16:24.120 --> 16:26.210
Since we're partners,

16:26.270 --> 16:27.720
we share the same goal.

16:27.750 --> 16:29.390
How could I possibly hurt you?

16:29.390 --> 16:30.510
If we're partners,

16:30.540 --> 16:31.930
then we're equals.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.820
I'm not your subordinate,

16:34.080 --> 16:36.140
and you have no right to decide for me.

16:36.150 --> 16:37.670
Are you worried that

16:38.010 --> 16:38.870
if I meet Xia Jingshi,

16:38.870 --> 16:39.720
I'll recall past events

16:39.720 --> 16:40.600
and be so eager to return him

16:40.600 --> 16:41.510
that I'll eventually

16:41.510 --> 16:42.910
stop cooperating with you?

16:42.910 --> 16:43.960
If I go back,

16:44.360 --> 16:45.960
your efforts will be in vain.

16:53.030 --> 16:54.750
So that's what you think of me.

16:56.000 --> 16:57.200
What else could it be?

16:57.840 --> 16:59.160
No matter what you say,

16:59.630 --> 17:00.550
I won't allow you

17:00.550 --> 17:01.630
to see Xia Jingshi.

17:09.720 --> 17:10.800
Why do you think

17:11.030 --> 17:12.000
His Highness won't let Miss Yixiao

17:12.000 --> 17:13.000
meet Xia Jingshi?

17:13.109 --> 17:14.440
Why should she meet him?

17:15.099 --> 17:16.160
Why shouldn't she?

17:17.200 --> 17:18.200
How would her meeting him

17:18.200 --> 17:19.460
benefit His Highness?

17:20.109 --> 17:21.079
What's the harm?

17:21.270 --> 17:21.880
Do you know what it means

17:21.880 --> 17:23.280
if she meets Xia Jingshi,

17:23.349 --> 17:24.240
remembers something,

17:24.240 --> 17:25.160
and regains her memory?

17:25.160 --> 17:27.220
Do you understand the implications?

17:30.790 --> 17:31.750
It means...

17:32.590 --> 17:34.120
she'll recover her memory.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.590
Then wouldn't she remember

17:36.590 --> 17:37.160
that His Highness

17:37.160 --> 17:38.200
is her enemy?

17:38.640 --> 17:39.790
What are you talking about?

17:39.790 --> 17:40.880
Whether she recovers or not,

17:40.880 --> 17:42.740
aren't we all her enemies anyway?

17:43.790 --> 17:44.830
Have you ever seen His Highness

17:44.830 --> 17:45.480
be this merciful

17:45.480 --> 17:46.910
to any enemy before?

17:47.510 --> 17:48.310
Well, no.

17:48.400 --> 17:49.210
Exactly.

17:49.830 --> 17:51.030
You've seen how His Highness's attitude

17:51.030 --> 17:51.640
toward her

17:51.640 --> 17:52.790
has changed these past few days.

17:52.790 --> 17:53.720
If at first

17:53.720 --> 17:54.960
His Highness simply wanted to use her,

17:54.960 --> 17:55.480
then

17:55.480 --> 17:57.480
things just aren't that simple now.

17:57.880 --> 17:58.980
I'm afraid His Highness

17:58.980 --> 18:00.640
wants her to recover her memory quickly,

18:00.640 --> 18:01.960
yet fears she might remember everything.

18:01.960 --> 18:02.860
Why?

18:03.070 --> 18:03.720
Because if she

18:03.720 --> 18:05.110
truly remembers everything,

18:05.110 --> 18:06.910
she'll no longer be Miss Yixiao,

18:08.070 --> 18:10.730
but Fu Yixiao,
one of the Three Heroes of Jinxiu.

18:11.030 --> 18:11.830
She'll become the female general

18:11.830 --> 18:14.090
who must fight His Highness to the death.

18:14.750 --> 18:16.110
You're overthinking.

18:16.880 --> 18:18.000
His Highness has always

18:18.000 --> 18:18.880
prioritized the bigger picture.

18:18.880 --> 18:19.750
When will he ever

18:19.750 --> 18:20.750
be caught up in these

18:20.750 --> 18:21.810
romantic affairs?

18:21.960 --> 18:22.440
I...

18:25.270 --> 18:26.900
Even if this time,

18:26.960 --> 18:27.720
His Highness has indeed

18:27.720 --> 18:29.200
been swept up by his feelings,

18:29.200 --> 18:30.860
I don't think it's a bad thing.

18:31.960 --> 18:32.930
In my opinion,

18:33.270 --> 18:34.950
Miss Yixiao is quite nice.

18:36.480 --> 18:37.510
Miss Yixiao?

18:39.880 --> 18:41.480
Since when are you so polite?

18:42.640 --> 18:43.640
Am I being polite?

18:45.720 --> 18:46.370
Fu Yixiao.

18:46.590 --> 18:47.030
Yixiao.

18:47.030 --> 18:47.790
Miss Yixiao.

18:47.880 --> 18:49.610
It rolls off the tongue nicely.

19:01.090 --> 19:01.880
This waist token was

19:01.880 --> 19:03.160
found on the corpse.

19:19.380 --> 19:20.350
This...

19:21.000 --> 19:23.460
This is the undercover guards'
waist token.

19:24.270 --> 19:25.780
In Jinxiu,

19:26.000 --> 19:28.030
who can mobilize
the undercover guards?

19:28.030 --> 19:29.610
His Highness can.

19:30.240 --> 19:31.390
Besides him,

19:31.550 --> 19:33.080
who else can mobilize them?

19:33.350 --> 19:35.160
Only Military Advisor Xiao.

19:43.830 --> 19:45.630
She actually revealed all this?

19:45.830 --> 19:47.240
Today, as Prince of Zhennan
was entering the court,

19:47.240 --> 19:49.110
Princess Xiyang deliberately
went to see him.

19:49.110 --> 19:50.350
But when they spoke,

19:50.370 --> 19:51.680
I didn't dare approach.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.940
I just heard

19:53.030 --> 19:54.070
the Princess mentioned

19:54.070 --> 19:54.830
that the Prince of Zhennan

19:54.830 --> 19:55.960
once saved her life.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.760
I never expected

19:58.110 --> 19:59.720
they had such a history.

20:00.070 --> 20:00.920
I also heard from

20:00.920 --> 20:02.620
the prisoner from Jinxiu that

20:03.030 --> 20:05.200
the female general from Jinxiu
staying at First Prince's Residence

20:05.200 --> 20:07.030
was saved by
the Prince of Zhennan years ago

20:07.030 --> 20:08.400
and then recruited into his army.

20:08.400 --> 20:10.790
The two have faced
life and death together many times,

20:10.790 --> 20:12.590
sharing an extraordinary bond.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.920
There are even rumors saying that

20:15.550 --> 20:19.020
they are... secretly engaged.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.350
Nonsense!

20:21.960 --> 20:23.400
Is the Princess aware of this?

20:23.400 --> 20:24.490
I dare not say.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.790
When the Princess met
the Prince of Zhennan today,

20:27.790 --> 20:28.550
it seems that he

20:28.550 --> 20:30.110
had mentioned a female general.

20:30.110 --> 20:31.400
After returning to the palace,

20:31.400 --> 20:32.960
the Princess became troubled,

20:32.960 --> 20:33.750
and she hasn't been eating

20:33.750 --> 20:35.110
for the entire day.

20:35.270 --> 20:37.350
Has she shown any signs of backing down?

20:37.350 --> 20:40.110
Has she ever mentioned she's unwilling to
marry for alliance?

20:40.110 --> 20:40.960
Not at all.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.510
The Princess is actually

20:42.510 --> 20:43.830
rather excited about
the marriage alliance.

20:43.830 --> 20:44.790
She also has deep feelings

20:44.790 --> 20:46.250
for the Prince of Zhennan.

20:47.070 --> 20:47.870
I understand.

20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
You may leave.

20:49.480 --> 20:49.960
Yes.

21:39.240 --> 21:40.100
Your Highness.

21:45.270 --> 21:46.130
Your Highness.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.510
The ceremonial procession from Jinxiu

21:47.510 --> 21:48.240
is about to enter

21:48.240 --> 21:49.180
Susha territory.

21:49.180 --> 21:50.000
In just a few days,

21:50.000 --> 21:51.330
they will reach Yujing.

21:51.400 --> 21:52.790
How many people have come?

21:52.790 --> 21:54.000
Not counting the escorts,

21:54.000 --> 21:56.960
over a hundred people and
more than thirty carriages.

21:56.960 --> 21:59.240
He didn't dispatch troops from
Zhennan Pass to accompany him?

21:59.240 --> 21:59.990
No.

22:00.270 --> 22:01.560
I heard that the escorts

22:01.560 --> 22:02.310
are all from

22:02.310 --> 22:03.790
Prince Zhennan's Mansion in Pingling City.

22:03.790 --> 22:05.200
The Emperor of Jinxiu has also decreed

22:05.200 --> 22:06.240
that on the day of the marriage alliance,

22:06.240 --> 22:08.590
the main camp at Zhennan Pass
must retreat 30 miles.

22:08.590 --> 22:10.240
From every angle,

22:10.350 --> 22:11.200
I think Jinxiu

22:11.200 --> 22:12.350
is showing genuine sincerity

22:12.350 --> 22:14.210
towards this marriage alliance.

22:15.920 --> 22:17.480
Before the procession enters the city,

22:17.480 --> 22:18.290
ask them to hand in

22:18.290 --> 22:20.200
a detailed list of all attendants.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.240
We must not be careless.

22:21.240 --> 22:21.680
Yes.

22:38.070 --> 22:39.200
Your left hand has only just

22:39.200 --> 22:40.730
begun to show improvement.

22:41.000 --> 22:41.830
If you keep this up,

22:41.830 --> 22:43.560
you'll truly become crippled.

22:43.680 --> 22:46.200
If it weren't for my left hand
being this weak,

22:46.200 --> 22:48.160
do you really think you could have
trapped me here?

22:48.160 --> 22:49.480
Are you that desperate to see him?

22:49.480 --> 22:49.950
Yes.

22:50.110 --> 22:51.030
Have you ever considered

22:51.030 --> 22:52.560
whether he wants to see you?

22:54.270 --> 22:55.500
To be honest,

22:56.070 --> 22:57.310
I actually hoped Xia Jingshi

22:57.310 --> 22:57.960
would storm

22:57.960 --> 23:00.350
the First Prince's Residence
for your sake.

23:00.350 --> 23:01.550
Then I could take the opportunity to end

23:01.550 --> 23:02.720
his thoughts of marrying my sister.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.720
But he didn't.

23:05.000 --> 23:07.070
He's more composed than I imagined.

23:07.720 --> 23:08.680
What do you mean?

23:09.350 --> 23:10.550
You aren't

23:10.550 --> 23:11.810
that important to him.

23:12.550 --> 23:13.410
In other words,

23:14.240 --> 23:16.160
if a general I had carefully trained,

23:16.160 --> 23:17.240
my good brother,

23:17.240 --> 23:18.560
fell into enemy hands,

23:18.790 --> 23:19.920
I'm afraid I could hardly match

23:19.920 --> 23:21.760
his profound sense of duty.

23:23.110 --> 23:24.770
You're trying to sow discord.

23:25.280 --> 23:26.540
He doesn't deserve it.

23:39.200 --> 23:45.670
[Zhengnian Hall]

23:41.720 --> 23:42.400
Headache?

23:42.830 --> 23:43.760
Let's go inside.

23:46.110 --> 23:46.750
All's good.

23:46.750 --> 23:48.550
You'll be fine after taking the medicine.

23:48.550 --> 23:48.960
Thank you.

23:48.960 --> 23:49.490
Okay.

23:49.790 --> 23:50.590
Go back and have a good rest.

23:50.590 --> 23:51.650
Thank you, Doctor.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.300
Hold still.

24:05.400 --> 24:06.260
If you dare spit it out,

24:06.260 --> 24:07.270
I'll make you drink

24:07.270 --> 24:08.930
this entire bowl of medicine.

24:09.890 --> 24:10.710
She's doing it on purpose.

24:10.710 --> 24:12.590
She's definitely doing it on purpose.

24:12.590 --> 24:13.240
What did he say?

24:13.240 --> 24:13.680
What did he say?

24:13.680 --> 24:14.510
Who's doing what on purpose?

24:14.510 --> 24:15.480
Young Mistress Ling,

24:15.480 --> 24:16.740
please don't mind him.

24:21.680 --> 24:22.440
Bear with it.

24:27.560 --> 24:28.400
Hang in there.

24:28.760 --> 24:29.870
It'll be over soon.

24:39.340 --> 24:40.240
Hang in there.

24:42.160 --> 24:42.840
Done.

24:43.510 --> 24:44.830
Change the dressing every three days.

24:44.830 --> 24:46.750
Don't move around while
you're on bed rest.

24:46.750 --> 24:47.480
Bone and tendon injuries

24:47.480 --> 24:48.780
aren't easy to heal.

24:48.830 --> 24:49.670
If you

24:49.690 --> 24:50.830
don't follow my instructions,

24:50.830 --> 24:52.000
don't come looking for me again.

24:52.000 --> 24:52.730
Understood.

24:53.110 --> 24:55.570
We'll strictly follow your medical advice.

24:56.310 --> 24:56.940
Alright,

24:57.240 --> 24:58.060
you may go now.

24:58.320 --> 24:59.960
Pay for the medicine at the front hall.

24:59.960 --> 25:01.350
As for the consultation fee...

25:01.350 --> 25:02.550
I'll waive it for you.

25:02.960 --> 25:03.510
This way.

25:04.920 --> 25:06.120
Young Mistress Ling.

25:10.350 --> 25:11.750
May I have a word with you?

25:14.400 --> 25:15.660
You want to see Yixiao?

25:17.270 --> 25:18.270
No way.

25:18.360 --> 25:19.350
Although I can enter

25:19.350 --> 25:20.350
Feng Suige's residence,

25:20.350 --> 25:21.030
I can't just

25:21.030 --> 25:22.350
bring you in as I please.

25:22.350 --> 25:23.400
We just want to see her—

25:23.400 --> 25:25.000
No need for all that trouble.

25:27.240 --> 25:28.350
This bamboo whistle

25:28.350 --> 25:29.350
was the token we used to contact Yixiao

25:29.350 --> 25:30.210
back in the day.

25:31.200 --> 25:33.530
But now that she had lost
all her memories,

25:34.000 --> 25:35.200
this method probably

25:35.240 --> 25:36.370
won't work anymore.

25:36.880 --> 25:38.810
But no matter what danger she is in,

25:38.960 --> 25:40.830
as long as she blows this bamboo whistle,

25:40.830 --> 25:42.640
we brothers will come without hesitation,

25:42.640 --> 25:43.790
even if it means walking through

25:43.790 --> 25:45.850
mountains of knives and seas of fire.

25:47.510 --> 25:49.170
Please, Young Mistress Ling.

25:54.000 --> 25:54.530
Alright.

25:55.400 --> 25:57.070
I'll pass this bamboo whistle

25:58.310 --> 25:59.110
to her for you.

25:59.480 --> 26:00.270
Why don't you just

26:00.270 --> 26:01.400
bring her here then?

26:01.400 --> 26:03.110
We really want to see her again.

26:03.110 --> 26:03.640
His Highness

26:03.640 --> 26:05.480
also wants to see her as soon as possible.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.720
We truly are her brothers.

26:06.720 --> 26:07.480
I swear,

26:07.480 --> 26:08.880
if I'm not her brother...

26:08.920 --> 26:10.520
This is Yujing City in Susha.

26:10.880 --> 26:12.680
This is Feng Suige's territory.

26:13.590 --> 26:15.160
Young Mistress Ling's willingness
to help us

26:15.160 --> 26:16.760
is already a great kindness.

26:17.550 --> 26:18.030
Please.

26:18.270 --> 26:18.830
Please.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.400
Brother Ning Fei!

26:21.550 --> 26:22.680
Brother Weiran!

26:22.720 --> 26:23.400
Brother!

26:24.880 --> 26:25.920
How come it's you guys?

26:25.920 --> 26:27.050
Shunzi, Fang, Nine.

26:28.390 --> 26:30.310
-What brings you here?
-Brother Ning Fei.

26:30.310 --> 26:31.690
I brought them here.

26:31.830 --> 26:33.130
When they came to Zhengnian Villa

26:33.130 --> 26:34.510
looking for Yixiao,

26:34.680 --> 26:35.360
I saw how pitiful

26:35.360 --> 26:36.620
the three of them were.

26:38.400 --> 26:39.210
Anyway, it's

26:39.230 --> 26:40.340
a long story.

26:41.160 --> 26:42.090
Brother Weiran,

26:42.110 --> 26:43.310
we've found our Master.

26:43.310 --> 26:44.440
We'll listen to you.

26:45.270 --> 26:45.920
Do you know how dangerous

26:45.920 --> 26:46.800
it is here?

26:47.310 --> 26:48.910
If anything happened to you,

26:48.920 --> 26:50.000
how would I explain to your Master?

26:50.000 --> 26:50.750
Alright.

26:51.640 --> 26:53.110
-Let me have a look.
-Shunzi.

26:53.110 --> 26:53.880
-Brother Ning Fei.
-Nine.

26:53.880 --> 26:54.480
Brother Weiran.

26:54.480 --> 26:55.480
Brother Ning Fei.

26:56.270 --> 26:57.310
As long as you guys are okay.

26:57.310 --> 26:57.680
All's good now.

26:57.680 --> 26:58.830
You've grown taller.

26:58.830 --> 27:00.630
Were you good to Sister Xueying?

27:05.270 --> 27:06.350
When they came to Zhengnian Villa

27:06.350 --> 27:07.280
looking for you,

27:07.310 --> 27:08.880
you were in the medical pool
at the back mountain.

27:08.880 --> 27:09.750
I didn't tell them

27:09.750 --> 27:10.680
your whereabouts

27:10.680 --> 27:12.740
because you were wounded by an arrow,

27:12.750 --> 27:14.510
and anyone who could hurt you
within five paces

27:14.510 --> 27:16.170
must be someone you knew well.

27:16.590 --> 27:18.450
They claimed to be your brothers,

27:18.480 --> 27:19.840
so I...

27:20.270 --> 27:21.600
You did the right thing,

27:21.790 --> 27:23.050
Don't blame yourself.

27:23.070 --> 27:24.470
Do you remember them now?

27:24.750 --> 27:26.010
I can't say I remember,

27:26.160 --> 27:27.890
just some fragments of memory.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.720
When those images appear,

27:30.790 --> 27:31.830
I feel as if I'm just

27:31.830 --> 27:33.160
a spectator,

27:33.270 --> 27:34.470
detached from it all.

27:34.830 --> 27:36.560
You speak with such sincerity,

27:36.830 --> 27:37.550
but I only feel

27:37.550 --> 27:39.210
a slight emotional response.

27:39.480 --> 27:40.510
I understand that

27:40.590 --> 27:41.590
I seem to have

27:41.640 --> 27:43.170
a very close bond with them.

27:43.270 --> 27:44.600
But this feeling is like

27:45.110 --> 27:46.450
flowers in a mirror

27:46.750 --> 27:47.950
and moon in the water.

27:48.310 --> 27:50.550
What about the Prince of Zhennan,
Xia Jingshi?

27:50.550 --> 27:52.310
You said when you met him
at the city gate,

27:52.310 --> 27:53.640
it seemed as though a flood of emotions

27:53.640 --> 27:55.350
welled up from the depths of your memory.

27:55.350 --> 27:56.750
Then why don't you go see him?

27:56.750 --> 27:58.160
Perhaps he is the key

27:58.200 --> 27:59.800
to unlocking your memories.

28:00.110 --> 28:01.040
I thought so too.

28:02.200 --> 28:03.200
But Feng Suige

28:03.580 --> 28:04.910
wouldn't let me see him.

28:05.550 --> 28:07.590
Just because he wouldn't let you go,
so you won't go?

28:07.590 --> 28:09.060
That's not like you.

28:09.550 --> 28:10.310
This is a great opportunity

28:10.310 --> 28:11.580
for you to slip away.

28:11.750 --> 28:12.720
Don't tell me you really plan

28:12.720 --> 28:13.270
to continue working

28:13.270 --> 28:14.310
with Feng Suige?

28:14.480 --> 28:15.200
I feel that

28:15.270 --> 28:16.960
whether or not you want to
return to Jinxiu,

28:16.960 --> 28:18.070
you should take this chance

28:18.070 --> 28:19.600
to get away from Feng Suige.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.610
This place of his

28:20.920 --> 28:22.980
isn't exactly a good place after all.

28:24.030 --> 28:26.030
Although he's not exactly a good person,

28:26.030 --> 28:26.810
and he doesn't really

28:26.810 --> 28:28.350
have good intentions toward me,

28:28.350 --> 28:29.640
when I was in trouble,

28:29.880 --> 28:30.980
he did protect me.

28:31.830 --> 28:32.650
Besides,

28:32.880 --> 28:34.550
I agreed to cooperate with him.

28:34.550 --> 28:36.130
If I go back on my word now,

28:36.310 --> 28:38.440
it would seem somewhat dishonorable.

28:38.720 --> 28:40.550
You're talking about honor with him?

28:40.550 --> 28:41.880
At a time like this?

28:42.030 --> 28:44.070
I've always kept my affairs separate.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.310
I always repay my debts,

28:45.310 --> 28:47.030
and I always collect what's owed to me.

28:47.030 --> 28:48.690
I need to help him at least once

28:49.000 --> 28:51.070
before I can leave with
a clear conscience.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.070
What should we do then?

28:52.070 --> 28:52.820
If Feng Suige

28:52.840 --> 28:53.880
refuses to let you see him,

28:53.880 --> 28:54.610
wouldn't you be

28:54.610 --> 28:55.870
trapped here forever?

29:00.110 --> 29:01.040
Here's the plan.

29:01.480 --> 29:03.940
Ask Ning Fei to send a message
to Xia Jingshi.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.480
You guys want to meet at my place?

29:06.890 --> 29:08.700
Just say I'm going to see the kids.

29:08.700 --> 29:10.720
Feng Suige's people will definitely be watching,

29:10.720 --> 29:12.480
but they'll only guard the front entrance.

29:12.480 --> 29:13.160
At that time,

29:13.160 --> 29:14.830
have Xia Jingshi come in
through the back door.

29:14.830 --> 29:16.310
I must see him as soon as possible

29:16.310 --> 29:17.970
and get all the answers I need.

29:18.590 --> 29:19.490
When?

29:20.160 --> 29:21.510
No time like the present,

29:21.510 --> 29:22.770
so let's make it today.

29:24.720 --> 29:26.030
Did Yixiao really send a message

29:26.030 --> 29:27.030
wanting to see us?

29:27.030 --> 29:27.830
That's right.

29:27.920 --> 29:29.550
Thankfully we have
Young Mistress Ling's help,

29:29.550 --> 29:30.720
otherwise we'd have no idea

29:30.720 --> 29:32.120
when we could see Yixiao.

29:32.240 --> 29:33.050
I knew Yixiao

29:33.070 --> 29:34.530
wouldn't forget about us.

29:36.030 --> 29:36.880
We are so thrilled

29:36.880 --> 29:38.480
we forgot her Moon-Shooting Bow.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.880
Didn't I just tell you we must

29:39.880 --> 29:41.350
avoid making a spectacle out of
meeting Yixiao?

29:41.350 --> 29:42.480
So why bring the Moon-Shooting Bow?

29:42.480 --> 29:44.110
What if Yixiao wants to see it?

29:44.110 --> 29:44.750
Enough.

29:45.110 --> 29:46.550
When we meet Yixiao later,

29:46.550 --> 29:47.160
both of you

29:47.510 --> 29:48.640
absolutely must not tell her

29:48.640 --> 29:49.970
too much about the past.

29:50.350 --> 29:51.750
Miss Ling specifically instructed that

29:51.750 --> 29:52.960
she shouldn't be upset.

29:52.960 --> 29:53.690
Understood?

29:53.830 --> 29:54.200
Yes.

29:54.510 --> 29:54.920
Yes.

29:56.030 --> 29:56.560
Let's go.

30:07.590 --> 30:09.510
This servant greets Your Highness.

30:09.510 --> 30:10.160
The Empress

30:10.160 --> 30:11.750
is hosting a banquet in the
Imperial Garden today

30:11.750 --> 30:13.160
and wishes to have a chat
with Your Highness.

30:13.160 --> 30:14.890
She sent me to escort you there.

30:16.720 --> 30:17.410
Today?

30:17.880 --> 30:19.610
Is Your Highness unavailable?

30:20.830 --> 30:21.350
No.

30:24.000 --> 30:25.260
I'll accept the order.

30:31.000 --> 30:31.480
I...

30:32.510 --> 30:33.440
Wait for me here.

30:34.350 --> 30:34.920
Yes.

30:47.670 --> 30:54.080
[Zhengnian Hall]

30:50.350 --> 30:51.950
I still feel a little unwell.

30:51.960 --> 30:53.030
Be careful.

30:59.200 --> 30:59.790
Master,

30:59.790 --> 31:01.300
let me pour you some tea.

31:01.350 --> 31:02.350
I'll do it myself.

31:06.110 --> 31:07.350
We agreed to meet here

31:07.350 --> 31:08.420
after two hours.

31:08.720 --> 31:09.620
Why haven't they shown up yet

31:09.620 --> 31:10.950
after all this waiting?

31:12.240 --> 31:13.260
Here, Shunzi.

31:14.000 --> 31:14.730
Thank you.

31:15.310 --> 31:16.750
Sister, I want some too.

31:19.720 --> 31:20.110
Here.

31:22.110 --> 31:22.910
Here, Fang.

31:28.750 --> 31:29.340
Sister.

31:29.590 --> 31:30.400
Don't worry.

31:30.720 --> 31:31.720
How about I send someone

31:31.720 --> 31:32.720
to the inn to ask?

31:33.240 --> 31:33.900
It's fine,

31:34.070 --> 31:35.400
let's wait a bit longer.

31:38.000 --> 31:38.800
They're here.

31:40.070 --> 31:41.080
Brother Ning Fei.

31:41.110 --> 31:42.960
-Brother Ning Fei!
-Brother Ning Fei!

31:42.960 --> 31:45.090
-Brother Ning Fei!
-Brother Ning Fei!

32:04.940 --> 32:06.380
This courtyard is nice.

32:06.420 --> 32:08.000
Full of birdsong and flowers,

32:08.000 --> 32:09.310
and quite secluded.

32:13.030 --> 32:13.750
Where is he?

32:15.000 --> 32:16.460
Why hasn't he arrived yet?

32:18.730 --> 32:20.290
No, Your Highness.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.030
He...

32:22.790 --> 32:24.700
For your father's sake,

32:25.070 --> 32:26.550
just this once.

32:28.750 --> 32:29.690
It was my idea,

32:29.830 --> 32:30.830
she had nothing to do with it.

32:30.830 --> 32:32.090
Direct any anger at me.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.200
Xueying,

32:33.400 --> 32:35.310
take the children inside quickly.

32:35.310 --> 32:36.440
Shunzi, Fang, Nine.

32:36.480 --> 32:37.130
Let's go.

32:38.000 --> 32:38.590
Let's go.

32:42.070 --> 32:43.510
Since we're working together,

32:43.510 --> 32:44.830
we are partners.

32:45.160 --> 32:47.790
It's perfectly normal for you
to get temperamental.

32:47.790 --> 32:49.720
But since you're so eager to see him,

32:49.720 --> 32:51.400
it would make me seem petty

32:51.400 --> 32:53.230
if I keep trying to stop you.

32:53.480 --> 32:54.610
So go ahead and meet,

32:54.790 --> 32:56.210
but in my presence,

32:56.400 --> 32:58.400
where both you can speak freely.

33:05.720 --> 33:07.960
Xiyang lost her birth mother
at a young age,

33:07.960 --> 33:09.840
so I raised her myself.

33:10.200 --> 33:11.960
Though she's not my biological daughter,

33:11.960 --> 33:14.020
I've always treated her as my own.

33:14.480 --> 33:15.440
Throughout her life,

33:15.440 --> 33:17.590
I've never let her suffer
the slightest injustice.

33:17.590 --> 33:19.990
Just thinking about her marrying far away,

33:20.830 --> 33:22.050
my heart just feels...

33:22.050 --> 33:23.100
indescribable.

33:23.750 --> 33:25.310
I feel empty somewhere.

33:26.680 --> 33:28.350
Your Majesty, please rest assured.

33:28.350 --> 33:29.890
When Princess Xiya marries into Jinxiu,

33:29.890 --> 33:30.750
she will not suffer

33:30.750 --> 33:31.680
any grievances whatsoever.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.510
That's good.

33:33.310 --> 33:34.720
Then I can entrust my daughter

33:34.720 --> 33:36.120
to you with peace of mind.

33:36.920 --> 33:38.720
I may be saying all of this to you,

33:39.030 --> 33:40.030
but Prince of Zhennan,

33:40.030 --> 33:41.560
please don't take offense.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.410
I wouldn't dare.

33:45.750 --> 33:46.570
By the way,

33:46.960 --> 33:49.020
I heard that there's a female general

33:49.350 --> 33:50.880
in your army.

33:58.200 --> 33:58.640
Yes,

33:59.590 --> 34:00.790
her name is Fu Yixiao.

34:01.680 --> 34:03.400
Is she that lady staying as a guest

34:03.400 --> 34:05.460
at the residence of our First Prince?

34:06.750 --> 34:08.030
Battlefields

34:08.110 --> 34:10.040
have always been the domain of men.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.480
How did you come to have

34:11.480 --> 34:12.610
a woman in your army?

34:13.480 --> 34:14.710
It's a long story.

34:15.400 --> 34:16.800
She was an orphan from childhood,

34:16.800 --> 34:18.000
so she suffered a lot.

34:18.280 --> 34:19.679
Later she came to my army,

34:19.760 --> 34:20.730
and over time,

34:20.760 --> 34:21.679
she developed

34:21.710 --> 34:23.570
remarkable battlefield skills.

34:24.110 --> 34:25.330
It seems like

34:25.590 --> 34:26.699
there must be a profound bond

34:26.699 --> 34:28.030
between you two.

34:36.550 --> 34:38.280
I am the Commander-in-Chief
of Zhennan Pass,

34:38.280 --> 34:39.480
and she is my general.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.040
In our army,

34:41.070 --> 34:42.280
even the common soldiers

34:42.280 --> 34:43.760
share a bond forged in life and death.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.840
Without such loyalty,

34:44.840 --> 34:45.710
how could anyone dare to

34:45.710 --> 34:47.310
turn their back to a comrade?

34:47.590 --> 34:49.120
I wonder if Your Majesty...

34:49.230 --> 34:51.090
is referring to this kind of bond?

34:51.590 --> 34:52.980
Is there anything else?

34:53.590 --> 34:54.710
Beyond this?

34:57.840 --> 34:59.040
Absolutely nothing.

35:01.400 --> 35:03.230
Perhaps I was just overthinking it.

35:03.230 --> 35:04.510
You should know that

35:04.840 --> 35:07.120
Xiyang is His Majesty's precious jewel

35:07.150 --> 35:09.460
and Susha's only princess.

35:09.710 --> 35:11.580
She also shares the same mother

35:11.630 --> 35:13.110
with the First Prince of Susha.

35:13.110 --> 35:15.070
Even though this marriage alliance
is a matter of great importance

35:15.070 --> 35:17.230
and concerns the welfare of
both countries,

35:17.230 --> 35:19.010
if Xiyang herself refuses,

35:19.230 --> 35:20.000
no one

35:20.030 --> 35:21.510
can force her to comply.

35:22.280 --> 35:24.030
She has lived sheltered in the palace,

35:24.030 --> 35:25.320
knowing little of the outside world.

35:25.320 --> 35:27.400
I've protected her too well
since childhood.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.930
Even the slightest trigger

35:29.960 --> 35:32.100
might cause her to change her mind.

35:32.590 --> 35:34.990
Thank you for your guidance, Your Majesty.

35:36.020 --> 35:37.610
This is hardly guidance.

35:37.920 --> 35:39.070
I simply wanted to meet

35:39.070 --> 35:40.670
my future son-in-law today.

35:40.880 --> 35:42.410
A good match is hard to find.

35:42.610 --> 35:43.750
Prince of Zhennan,

35:44.030 --> 35:46.090
you must treasure this opportunity.

36:10.020 --> 36:12.080
It was you who interfered, wasn't it?

36:12.600 --> 36:14.190
Such underhanded tactics

36:14.320 --> 36:16.380
are exactly what I'd expect from you.

36:16.710 --> 36:17.580
Feng Suige.

36:17.800 --> 36:19.400
Only now do I see clearly that

36:19.400 --> 36:20.630
your definition of cooperation

36:20.630 --> 36:21.730
is just a different way

36:21.730 --> 36:23.260
to imprison me by your side.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.350
Not only do you want to

36:24.350 --> 36:25.360
uncover the truth from me,

36:25.360 --> 36:26.920
you want me to submit to you.

36:27.280 --> 36:29.920
Otherwise you wouldn't
repeatedly stand in my way.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.110
You show me kindness on one hand

36:31.110 --> 36:32.510
to make me feel indebted,

36:32.630 --> 36:34.000
yet you control me on the other

36:34.000 --> 36:35.630
and claim it's for my own good.

36:35.630 --> 36:37.550
But in reality, they're all at
your disposal.

36:37.550 --> 36:38.240
I'm nothing more than

36:38.240 --> 36:39.370
a pawn in your game.

36:40.030 --> 36:41.360
But you seem to have forgotten that

36:41.360 --> 36:42.490
I, Fu Yixiao, have never been

36:42.490 --> 36:43.880
someone who submits to others.

36:43.880 --> 36:44.590
I didn't want to

36:44.590 --> 36:45.280
fall out with you before

36:45.280 --> 36:46.000
because I was mindful of

36:46.000 --> 36:47.000
what you've done for me.

36:47.000 --> 36:48.070
For every kindness shown to me,

36:48.070 --> 36:49.320
I will repay it a hundredfold.

36:49.320 --> 36:50.290
You must have figured

36:50.290 --> 36:51.750
I wouldn't resist, right?

36:57.710 --> 37:00.480
How foolish I was to have actually
thought for a moment

37:00.480 --> 37:02.410
that you genuinely cared about me.

37:03.030 --> 37:04.630
I thought you were my friend.

37:06.400 --> 37:09.190
Looking back now, it's laughable.

37:13.190 --> 37:13.960
Fu Yixiao, you—

37:13.960 --> 37:15.880
I'm going to see Xia Jingshi now.

37:16.030 --> 37:16.960
I'll kill anyone

37:17.150 --> 37:18.280
who tries to stop me.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.880
How did this turn into an argument now?

37:26.880 --> 37:27.320
Move!

37:27.630 --> 37:28.160
Alright.

37:30.590 --> 37:31.590
Go and have a look.

37:32.590 --> 37:33.480
Miss Yixiao.

37:39.760 --> 37:40.960
Your Highness, what's wrong?

37:40.960 --> 37:42.190
S-Such a temper,

37:42.280 --> 37:43.410
like she's gone mad.

37:44.360 --> 37:45.220
Your Highness.

37:45.320 --> 37:46.280
Where did she go?

37:46.400 --> 37:46.960
Miss Yixiao

37:46.960 --> 37:47.800
is going to the inn alone.

37:47.800 --> 37:49.800
Should we send someone to watch her?

37:50.320 --> 37:51.470
Let her die.

37:53.960 --> 37:54.820
Your Highness.

37:57.710 --> 37:58.320
Yun Fang.

37:59.150 --> 38:00.120
Go watch her.

38:00.400 --> 38:01.030
Got it.

38:10.710 --> 38:11.450
Boss,

38:11.590 --> 38:12.710
two more bowls of porridge, please.

38:12.710 --> 38:13.640
Coming right up!

38:16.960 --> 38:19.520
[Inn]

38:25.070 --> 38:25.710
Hurry up. Hurry up.

38:25.710 --> 38:26.880
Where is he?

38:26.920 --> 38:27.580
Over there.

38:34.840 --> 38:35.860
Yixiao!

38:35.960 --> 38:36.740
Yixiao!

38:36.920 --> 38:37.800
Yixiao!

38:40.400 --> 38:40.960
Yixiao!

38:44.800 --> 38:45.610
You really are okay.

38:45.610 --> 38:46.460
I knew it.

38:47.760 --> 38:48.460
Yixiao.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.280
When we heard you wanted to see us,

38:50.280 --> 38:51.990
Your Highness was so excited.

38:52.030 --> 38:52.960
But just as we were about to leave,

38:52.960 --> 38:54.190
he was summoned to the palace
by Empress Zhuang.

38:54.190 --> 38:54.920
So...

38:55.510 --> 38:56.210
Yixiao.

38:56.920 --> 38:57.860
I can't believe you actually

38:57.860 --> 38:58.590
came to find us yourself.

38:58.590 --> 38:59.030
Yixiao,

38:59.030 --> 38:59.670
are you eating well and

38:59.670 --> 39:00.880
sleeping well over there?

39:00.880 --> 39:02.140
Don't get too excited.

39:02.280 --> 39:03.680
Yixiao is still injured.

39:04.840 --> 39:05.750
My bad,

39:05.800 --> 39:07.000
I'm being too abrupt.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.050
Yixiao,

39:08.230 --> 39:09.280
how's your injury?

39:09.280 --> 39:10.510
I heard you were badly hurt.

39:10.510 --> 39:11.760
Let me see. Is it your arm?

39:11.760 --> 39:12.480
Yixiao,

39:13.280 --> 39:14.740
do you still recognize us?

39:22.510 --> 39:23.450
I'm Ning Fei,

39:24.360 --> 39:25.440
do you remember me?

39:26.960 --> 39:28.070
You're Ning Fei.

39:29.150 --> 39:30.750
Then you must be Xiao Weiran.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.390
See?

39:33.590 --> 39:34.590
You were overthinking it.

39:34.590 --> 39:35.230
How could Yixiao

39:35.230 --> 39:36.160
not remember us?

39:36.230 --> 39:36.920
Yixiao.

39:37.110 --> 39:38.630
Has Feng Suige given you a hard time?

39:38.630 --> 39:39.320
A few days ago,

39:39.320 --> 39:40.550
he was doing everything to keep us away.

39:40.550 --> 39:41.230
Today is the day

39:41.230 --> 39:42.490
of our joyous reunion.

39:42.710 --> 39:43.970
Let's not mention him.

39:47.000 --> 39:47.670
Yixiao.

39:48.070 --> 39:49.800
If that Feng Suige bullies you,

39:50.070 --> 39:51.430
just tell us

39:51.710 --> 39:53.310
and I'll settle the score for you.

39:53.310 --> 39:54.190
Remember,

39:54.320 --> 39:55.520
now that we're here,

39:55.550 --> 39:57.080
you have someone to rely on.

40:04.670 --> 40:06.180
Thank you, Ning Fei.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.800
Why are you thanking me?

40:07.800 --> 40:08.360
-Yeah.
-She…

40:08.360 --> 40:09.690
Why be so polite with us?

40:10.960 --> 40:12.220
Your Highness is back.

40:12.590 --> 40:13.450
Your Highness!

40:25.800 --> 40:28.070
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

40:28.710 --> 40:31.470
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

40:30.400 --> 40:31.260
Your Highness!

40:31.840 --> 40:32.540
Look!

40:32.190 --> 40:34.160
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

40:32.670 --> 40:33.830
Look who's here!

40:34.960 --> 40:38.120
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

40:36.710 --> 40:37.570
Your Highness.

40:38.720 --> 40:40.890
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

40:40.070 --> 40:40.640
Yixiao.

40:40.760 --> 40:42.110
Quick, pay your respects to His Highness.

40:41.640 --> 40:44.350
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

40:42.400 --> 40:43.230
Hurry up.

40:45.140 --> 40:50.890
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

40:45.840 --> 40:46.460
Alright.

40:46.710 --> 40:47.240
Let's go.

40:47.920 --> 40:48.510
Let's go.

40:51.410 --> 40:53.400
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

40:53.890 --> 40:57.520
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert ♪

40:58.090 --> 40:59.780
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

41:00.180 --> 41:03.190
♪ Who sighs for me, enduring separations ♪

41:34.230 --> 41:34.880
Yixiao.

41:38.670 --> 41:39.230
Yixiao.

41:39.710 --> 41:41.280
I had planned to go and meet you,

41:41.280 --> 41:42.510
but something came up.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.150
I know.

41:44.030 --> 41:45.430
They told me everything.

41:47.030 --> 41:48.430
Why didn't you come back?

41:49.030 --> 41:49.800
I...

41:50.480 --> 41:51.810
I knew you weren't dead.

41:52.000 --> 41:53.190
I believed you would find

41:53.190 --> 41:53.990
your way home.

41:54.360 --> 41:55.960
But why wouldn't you return?

41:56.230 --> 41:57.360
Yixiao, do you know?

41:58.030 --> 41:59.510
I've been looking for you all along.

41:59.510 --> 42:00.970
I've been waiting for you.

42:02.000 --> 42:03.800
I was afraid you'd never return.

42:04.150 --> 42:04.840
I...

42:07.760 --> 42:09.290
I don't remember anything.

42:10.760 --> 42:12.290
You don't even remember me?

42:12.840 --> 42:14.300
Then what do you remember?

42:14.670 --> 42:15.200
Ning Fei?

42:15.480 --> 42:16.210
Xiao Weiran?

42:16.840 --> 42:17.570
Everything about Pingling City,

42:17.570 --> 42:19.170
you don't remember any of it?

42:22.110 --> 42:23.800
Fang and Shunzi told me

42:23.830 --> 42:24.960
a bit about the past.

42:25.480 --> 42:26.590
Feng Suige told me some stories

42:26.590 --> 42:27.920
about the battlefield.

42:28.230 --> 42:29.320
Other than that...

42:31.920 --> 42:33.850
You don't remember anything else?

42:34.150 --> 42:35.190
Nothing at all?

42:37.190 --> 42:37.920
What about everything

42:37.920 --> 42:38.800
between us?

42:39.760 --> 42:40.530
All that we've shared

42:40.530 --> 42:41.240
through thick and thin,

42:41.240 --> 42:42.840
you don't remember any of it?

42:46.280 --> 42:46.800
Yixiao.

42:48.030 --> 42:48.760
Look at me.

42:49.840 --> 42:51.000
Look at my face.

42:51.710 --> 42:52.800
Tell me honestly,

42:53.710 --> 42:55.110
do you remember?
